WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.278
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Research a Topic Quickly.

2
00:00:05.578 --> 00:00:10.018
Learn about a topic fast and check it. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:11.017 --> 00:00:15.979
Step one. Ask for a simple overview of your topic in words you can understand.

4
00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:20.866
Step two. Ask for five key points and five key words.

5
00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:26.885
Step three. Ask which trusted websites you can read. Then open them yourself.

6
00:00:27.883 --> 00:00:36.076
Step four. Make your own notes from the trusted sources, with the name of each source. AI is the start of your research, not the end.

7
00:00:37.083 --> 00:00:40.873
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:41.173 --> 00:00:43.684
Ask AI for an overview of a school topic.

9
00:00:43.984 --> 00:00:45.635
List 5 key words.

10
00:00:45.935 --> 00:00:49.305
Read one trusted website and write 3 notes.

11
00:00:49.605 --> 00:00:50.582
Well done!

